              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- only Food orders used</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- free delivery orders excluded</run>
